# uv lockfile: deliberately not versioned. Nothing consumes it (CI and
# CONTRIBUTING install with `uv pip install -r requirements_dev.txt`), the
# pyproject declares no dependencies for it to resolve, and dependabot owns
# the exact pins in requirements_dev.txt. Committing it would add a second,
# unmaintained source of truth. Revisit only if the project moves to
# `uv sync --locked` with dev deps declared in `[dependency-groups]`.
uv.lock

